WEBVTT

00:07:58.075 --> 00:08:02.532
a gradual replacement, but without delay,

00:08:02.556 --> 00:08:07.297
of fossil fuels with clean energy sources.

00:08:08.027 --> 00:08:10.645
We only have a few years.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:16.060
Scientists estimate approximately

00:08:16.084 --> 00:08:18.567
less than 30 --

00:08:18.591 --> 00:08:23.016
we have a few years, less than 30 --

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:25.633
to drastically reduce

00:08:25.657 --> 00:08:29.838
greenhouse gas emissions
into the atmosphere.